"1">Dyspnea</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5.8 &#x000b1; 0.78</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.9 &#x000b1; 0.567</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.0001<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-copd-3-423">&#x02020;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6 MWT</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">245.9 &#x000b1; 52.37</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">302.4 &#x000b1; 41.3</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.0054<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-copd-3-423">&#x02020;</xref></td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn3-copd-3-423"><label>*</label><p><bold>Notes:</bold> Values are expressed as mean &#x000b1; SD.</p></fn><fn id="tfn4-copd-3-423"><label>&#x02020;</label><p>Statistically significant.</p></fn><fn id="tfn5-copd-3-423"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> 6 MWT, 6 minute walk test; SD, standard deviation; SIMT, specified inspiratory muscle training.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>